{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.09914140436326857,"w":0.080342864990234353,"h":0.019145496040407162,"c":1,"x":0.79126420638570893,"t":"Reading"},{"c":1,"x":0.088477361132501167,"t":"'In order to get people interested in habitat restoration, you need to plant a tree that is useful to","w":0.75514404296875004,"y":0.14534883706322488,"h":0.016017476296396826},{"c":1,"w":0.77777776082356764,"h":0.015988372380376759,"t":"them,' says Whaley. So, he has been working with local families to attempt to create a sustainable","x":0.088477374628262162,"y":0.16279069752859288},{"y":0.17873969376817123,"c":1,"x":0.088477359239775996,"t":"income from the huarangos by turning their products into foodstuffs. 'Boil up the beans and you","h":0.016027748233718775,"w":0.76748972574869789},{"y":0.19457367368825695,"h":0.018890676284987751,"t":"get this thick brown syrup like molasses. You can also use it in drinks, soups or stews? The pods","w":0.76556035359700536,"c":1,"x":0.08841235668147486},{"t":"can be ground into flour to make cakes, and the seeds roasted into a sweet, chocolatey 'coffee.","x":0.088388083495104394,"w":0.75738805135091147,"c":1,"y":0.21044530437415154,"h":0.021847400283364182},{"c":1,"x":0.088477375868537766,"y":0.22819767464909335,"w":0.45061726888020837,"t":"'It's packed full of vitamins and minerals,' Whaley says.","h":0.01744185965530165},{"y":0.26155445078526696,"c":1,"t":"And some farmers are already planting huarangos. Alberto Benevides, owner of Ica Valley's only","h":0.017952141688765799,"w":0.77375640869140616,"x":0.088429711221286691},{"y":0.27906976729588651,"h":0.015988372380376759,"t":"certified organic farm, which Whaley helped set up, has been planting the tree for 13 years. He","c":1,"w":0.75720163981119792,"x":0.088477369294296962},{"x":0.088399244403830152,"w":0.74293528238932294,"h":0.017735796907063173,"c":1,"y":0.29458665835213094,"t":"produces syrup and flour, and sells these products at an organic farmers' market in Lima. His"},{"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.74074076334635408,"y":0.31242638383521926,"t":"farm is relatively small and doesn't yet provide him with enough to live on, but he hopes this","x":0.088477354848294193,"c":1},{"t":"will change. The organic market is growing rapidly in Peru, Benevides says. 'I am investing in","h":0.017506916756062751,"c":1,"w":0.76543207804361979,"y":0.3284883719297278,"x":0.088477376688762779},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.34593023241062326,"c":1,"w":0.092592595418294274,"t":"the future.'","x":0.088477364744197692},{"x":0.088477375570714306,"y":0.37926972886885002,"w":0.77160491943359377,"h":0.016195524146054074,"t":"But even if Whaley can convince the local people to fall in love with the huarango again, there is","c":1},{"y":0.39534883705885082,"x":0.088477366669375973,"h":0.016017476296396826,"c":1,"t":"still the threat of the larger farms. Some of these cut across the forests and break up the corridors","w":0.77572016398111976},{"w":0.76337448120117191,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.41279069752831199,"t":"that allow the essential movement of mammals, birds and pollen up and down the narrow forest","x":0.088477368351282171},{"h":0.017334597692051479,"y":0.42868478157952927,"t":"strip. In the hope of counteracting this, he's persuading farmers to let him plant forest corridors","w":0.76141250610351563,"c":1,"x":0.088428967082262111},{"c":1,"t":"on their land. He believes the extra woodland will also benefit the farms by reducing their water","y":0.44611307446375503,"w":0.76543207804361979,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.088477376508804842},{"t":"usage through a lowering of evaporation and providing a refuge for bio-control insects.","h":0.016019188192342937,"c":1,"y":0.46366279055120241,"w":0.69547322591145833,"x":0.088477378710937457},{"t":"'If we can record biodiversity and see how it all works, then we're in a good position to move","w":0.74279836018880208,"h":0.016044868316470673,"x":0.090534976168748546,"y":0.49558303880137977,"c":1},{"t":"on from there. Desert habitats can reduce down to very little,' Whaley explains. 'It's not like a","h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"x":0.088477364313492526,"w":0.74897120157877606,"y":0.51148409896143365},{"w":0.75308639526367183,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.088477378398976611,"t":"rainforest that needs to have this huge expanse. Life has always been confined to corridors and","y":0.52906976729595689},{"w":0.74074076334635419,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"islands here. If you just have a few trees left, the population can grow up quickly because it's","y":0.54651162776104811,"c":1,"x":0.088477354848007603},{"y":0.55983912338598629,"c":1,"x":0.088402922423534661,"t":"used to exploiting water when it arrives.?' He sees his project as a model that has the potential to","w":0.76350311279296879,"h":0.020499581021330204},{"t":"be rolled out across other arid areas around the world. 'If we can do it here, in the most fragile","x":0.090534983401410418,"y":0.57979976454426907,"w":0.75102879842122394,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"t":"system on Earth, then that's a real message of hope for lots of places, including Africa, where","c":1,"y":0.59593023230450193,"x":0.088477382516740408,"h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.74691355387369784},{"x":0.088413898120018458,"h":0.018279809131779623,"y":0.6118725444696429,"t":"there is drought and they just can't afford to wait for rain'","c":1,"w":0.467243398030599},{"x":0.84773662540171113,"w":0.022633744875590001,"y":0.92151162774963047,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"81"}],"h":3395}